    <data key="d0">Novartis Buying Engine Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vp8oPiHN4cA</data>
    <data key="d2">Architecture for Novartis Buying Engine, an internal procurement portal that uses ML pipelines (SageMaker, Step Functions) and multi-database indexing (DynamoDB, Elasticsearch, Neptune) for search and recommendations.</data>
    <data key="d3">Healthcare &amp; Life Sciences, ML &amp; AI, E-Commerce</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
